<div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl space-y-6">
  <section class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm">
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-5 md:flex-row md:items-center">
      <%= image_tag "aidan.JPEG", alt: "Aidan DeVaney", class: "h-28 w-28 rounded-full object-cover" %>
      <div>
        <h1 class="text-3xl font-semibold text-slate-900">About Fathership</h1>
        <p class="mt-2 text-slate-700">
          I built Fathership as a personal project while learning full-stack development.
          The goal is simple: make supportive conversation easier to access.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm">
    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900">How it is built</h2>
    <p class="mt-2 text-slate-700">
      The app runs on Ruby on Rails with Tailwind CSS and PostgreSQL.
      It is intentionally lean so it can stay inexpensive to operate as a passion project.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm">
    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900">Support or feedback</h2>
    <p class="mt-2 text-slate-700">
      Suggestions and bug reports are welcome through this repository's Issues tab.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-3 text-slate-700">
      This project is maintained as a personal learning archive and may not receive frequent updates.
    </p>
  </section>
</div>
